                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ole wake ashindanaye na Muumba wake! Kigae kimoja katika vigae vya dunia! Je! Udongo umwambie yeye aufinyangaye; Unatengeneza nini? Au chombo ulichotengeneza hakina mikono? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole wake amwambiaye baba yake, Wazaa nini? Au mwanamke, Una uchungu wa kujifungua nini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " BWANA, Mtakatifu wa Israeli, na Muumba wake, asema hivi; Niulize habari za mambo yatakayokuja; mambo ya wana wangu, na habari ya kazi ya mikono yangu; haya! Niagizeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mimi nimeiumba dunia, nimemhuluku mwanadamu juu yake; Mimi, naam, mikono yangu mimi, imezitanda mbingu, na jeshi lake lote nimeliamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
