        },
        {
          "text": " BWANA asema hivi, Kazi ya Misri, na bidhaa ya Kushi, na Waseba, watu walio warefu, watakujia, nao watakuwa wako; watakufuata; watakuja katika minyororo; wataanguka chini mbele yako, watakuomba, wakisema, Hakika Mungu yu ndani yako; wala hapana mwingine, hapana Mungu tena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.14"
            ]
          }
